.TH GRUNDSTRUKHTML\-NATIVE 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grundStrukHtml\-native \- native structural HTML generation helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grundStrukHtml\-native
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grundStrukHtml\-native
is the compiled structural HTML helper used during parity checks and installed runtime smoke tests.

.SH NOTES
This command is installed because it is a build or diagnostic target of the native Mojo port. Normal users usually start with .BR reta (1), .BR rp (1), .BR rpl (1), .BR rpe (1), or .BR rpb (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1)
